@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"

title Curriculum & Subject Structure

package "Subject Catalog" as SubjectCatalog #F3F4F6 {
  rectangle "Subject A\n(e.g. Math 101)" as SubA
  rectangle "Subject B\n(e.g. English 101)" as SubB
  rectangle "Subject C\n(e.g. Science 101)" as SubC
}

package "Curriculum: BEED" #DBEAFE {
  rectangle "Year 1 - 1st Sem" as Y1S1
  rectangle "Year 1 - 2nd Sem" as Y1S2
  rectangle "Year 2 - 1st Sem" as Y2S1
}

package "Block Section: BEED-1A" #D1FAE5 {
  rectangle "Enrolled Students" as BlockStudents
  rectangle "Assigned Subjects" as BlockSubjects
}

SubA --> Y1S1 : placed in
SubB --> Y1S1 : placed in
SubC --> Y1S2 : placed in

Y1S1 --> BlockSubjects : subjects drawn from
BlockSubjects --> BlockStudents : students take

note bottom of SubjectCatalog
  Subjects are the master list.
  Curriculums organize them by
  year level and semester.
  Block sections inherit subjects
  from the curriculum.
end note

@enduml
